message: "If you use MolDraft, please cite this benchmark."
type: dataset
title: "MolDraft Benchmark Dataset"
abstract: "MolDraft benchmarks 3D molecular structure generation from 2D chemical drawings. The repository includes 300 drawing–structure pairs, evaluation records, a paired tool ablation, and the verifier."
